  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1036825,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Being Boiled! - Music for Commodore 64\n\nDive into a bizarre and darkly comedic world with *Being Boiled!*, a surreal adventure game unlike anything you've experienced on the Commodore 64. You awaken as a disembodied head, floating in a bizarre, post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unsettling characters and nonsensical situations. Your quest? To find your body and unravel the mysteries of this strange, boiled existence.\n\nPrepare for a truly unique gameplay experience. *Being Boiled!* is notorious for its unconventional narrative, delivered through cryptic, often hilarious, text-based interactions and bizarre, dreamlike visuals. There are no traditional puzzles or combat; instead, you must navigate the surreal environment, interpret the bizarre dialogue, and make choices that influence the unfolding story. \n\nThe game's soundtrack, composed by Owen Vince, is an integral part of the experience, perfectly complementing the unsettling atmosphere.  *Being Boiled!* is a cult classic, celebrated for its originality, dark humor, and unforgettable, if perplexing, journey.  Are you brave enough to face the boil?"
    },
